\n08、人物标记处显示真实人物其他保持不变\n\n\n【多图模式】\n\n01、让image1的女人穿上image2的裙子，全身裙子。【可以再加场景和动作】保持女人面部特征不变\n\n02、让女人置于xx场景里做xx，加具体画面【比如：手拿着筷子在夹桌子上火锅里的食材】保持光影自然融合\n\n03、左边的角色模仿右边角色的动作和姿势"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [980.044677734375, 258.9518127441406], "pos": [2016.0303955078125, 1722.9403076171875], "id": 23, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 2}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [27], "label": "字符串", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "size": [422.4156188964844, 146.86489868164062], "pos": [2423.36865234375, 2039.38037109375], "widgets_values": ["把产品软装方案图里面的产品生成一张室内效果图，拍摄高级商业广告照片，画质高清，8k，最佳摄影角度。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "id": 25, "type": "Text Multiline", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Text Multiline"}, "order": 3}, {"outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [21], "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"name": "MASK", "label": "遮罩", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "遮罩"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["50a35dc3f7ebcefe85bc5eb4088d1cf80b8e9ecfb14ab41eecb8d80cd118db65.png", "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "image"}, "name": "image", "label": "image", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "label": "upload", "type": "IMAGEUPLOAD", "localized_name": "选择文件上传"}], "flags": {}, "type": "LoadImage", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [473.73370361328125, 673.9033813476562], "pos": [1525.1883544921875, 2064.55224609375], "id": 24, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LoadImage"}, "order": 1}], "extra": {"links_added_by_ue": [], "ue_links": [], "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "ds": {"offset": [-1782.613250837913, -1760.9426512469306], "scale": 0.724729500000003}}, "groups": [{"color": "#b58b2a", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 1, "title